{
  "info": {
    "name": "Synthoria LLM API",
    "description": "API FastAPI pour l'ingestion de PDF, la recherche vectorielle, la génération de cours structurés via Gemini, et la génération vidéo pédagogique via HuggingFace Inference.\n\n→ Quiz : questions QCM, points calculés côté serveur (20/20), répartition 50% difficile / 25% normale / 25% facile.\n→ Vidéo : POST /video/generate/{session_id} → 202 Accepted, polling GET /video/generate/{job_id}/status, téléchargement GET /video/{job_id}/download.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID d'une session de cours (remplir après POST /courses/generate)"
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID d'un job vidéo (remplir après POST /video/generate/{sessionId})"
    },
    {
      "key": "planId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID d'un plan de cours (remplir après POST /courses/plan)"
    },
    {
      "key": "sectionId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Id d'une section du cours (champ sections[].id de la réponse de génération)"
    },
    {
      "key": "cardId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Id d'une flashcard (champ flashcards[].card_id, ex. 1-0)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vérifie l'état de l'API et la disponibilité d'Ollama. Retourne 200 avec { status, ollama_reachable }."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Generate (Ollama)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /generate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"prompt\": \"Explique Docker en une phrase\",\n  \"model\": \"llama3.2\",\n  \"stream\": false\n}"
            },
            "description": "Génère une réponse via Ollama. model optionnel (défaut: llama3.2). Codes: 200 ok, 400 prompt vide, 404 modèle introuvable, 413 prompt trop long, 503 Ollama indisponible."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PDF",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /pdf/ingest — Un seul fichier",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/ingest",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "ingest"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "/path/to/document.pdf"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envoie un seul fichier PDF. Détection de doublons activée. Codes: 200 succès/doublon, 400 pas un PDF, 422 non exploitable."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /pdf/ingest — Plusieurs fichiers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/ingest",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "ingest"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "/path/to/document1.pdf"
                },
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "/path/to/document2.pdf"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envoie plusieurs fichiers PDF. Chaque fichier est ingéré individuellement. Codes: 200 succès, 400 aucun fichier."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /pdf/search",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/search",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"Quel est le point clé du document ?\",\n  \"top_k\": 5\n}"
            },
            "description": "Recherche sémantique dans les documents PDF indexés. query requis, top_k optionnel (1-20, défaut 5)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /pdf/search — Filtre par fichier",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/search",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"Explique le gradient\",\n  \"top_k\": 10,\n  \"filename\": \"presentation_descente_gradient_marp.pdf\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Recherche vectorielle filtrée sur un seul fichier. Le champ filename accepte un string ou une liste."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /pdf/search — Filtre multi-fichiers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/search",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"Quels sont les concepts communs ?\",\n  \"top_k\": 15,\n  \"filename\": [\"presentation_descente_gradient_marp.pdf\", \"cours_regression.pdf\"]\n}"
            },
            "description": "Recherche vectorielle filtrée sur plusieurs fichiers."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /pdf/files",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pdf/files",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "pdf",
                "files"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Liste les fichiers PDF stockés. Retourne FileListResponse { status, files: [{ id, filename }] }."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Courses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mode 2 — Un seul fichier",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Explique le principe de fonctionnement\",\n  \"filename\": \"presentation_descente_gradient_marp.pdf\",\n  \"top_k\": 6\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mode 2 : un seul fichier + question. Retrieval RAG puis Gemini. Quiz avec correct_option_indices, difficulty, points, time_limit_seconds. Codes: 200, 413, 429, 500/502/503."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mode 2 — Plusieurs fichiers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Compare les concepts des deux cours\",\n  \"filename\": [\"presentation_descente_gradient_marp.pdf\", \"cours_regression.pdf\"],\n  \"top_k\": 20\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mode 2 : plusieurs fichiers. Recherche séparée par fichier. Codes: 200, 429, 500/502/503."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mode 2 — Forcé avec mode explicite",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Explique le principe de fonctionnement\",\n  \"filename\": \"presentation_descente_gradient_marp.pdf\",\n  \"top_k\": 20,\n  \"mode\": \"file_question\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mode 2 forcé explicitement. Le champ mode prime sur l'auto-détection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mode 3 — Question seule (recherche web)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Qu'est-ce que la régression linéaire ?\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mode 3 : pas de filename → question_only. Gemini utilise la recherche web. Codes: 200, 429, 500/502/503."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /courses/plan — Un fichier",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/plan",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "plan"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Explique le cours en complet\",\n  \"filename\": \"cours-transformateurs.pdf\",\n  \"top_k\": 20,\n  \"full_document\": false\n}"
            },
            "description": "Étape 1 de la génération en deux temps : retourne un plan détaillé (structure uniquement, sans contenu Quoi/Pourquoi/Comment) et un plan_id. Copier plan_id dans la variable {{planId}}. Mêmes paramètres que POST /courses/generate. Codes: 200 ok, 413 question trop longue, 422 body invalide, 429 quota Gemini, 502 plan invalide, 503 Gemini/Ollama ou persistance indisponible."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /courses/plan — Question seule (recherche web)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/plan",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "plan"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"Comment fonctionne un transformateur électrique ?\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Étape 1 de la génération en deux temps : retourne un plan détaillé (structure uniquement, sans contenu Quoi/Pourquoi/Comment) et un plan_id. Copier plan_id dans la variable {{planId}}. Mêmes paramètres que POST /courses/generate. Codes: 200 ok, 413 question trop longue, 422 body invalide, 429 quota Gemini, 502 plan invalide, 503 Gemini/Ollama ou persistance indisponible."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /courses/generate/from-plan",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/generate/from-plan",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "courses",
                "generate",
                "from-plan"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan_id\": \"{{planId}}\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"introduction\",\n      \"title\": \"Introduction aux transformateurs\",\n      \"objective\": \"Situer le transformateur et ses prérequis.\",\n      \"subtopics\": [\n        \"Rôle\",\n        \"Prérequis\"\n      ],\n      \"order\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"development\",\n      \"title\": \"Principe de fonctionnement\",\n      \"objective\": \"Comprendre l'induction mutuelle entre primaire et secondaire.\",\n      \"subtopics\": [\n        \"Flux magnétique\",\n        \"Rapport de transformation\"\n      ],\n      \"order\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"summary\",\n      \"title\": \"Résumé\",\n      \"objective\": \"Retenir l'essentiel.\",\n      \"subtopics\": [],\n      \"order\": 3\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "description": "Étape 2 : génère le cours complet à partir du plan validé ou édité (sections renvoyées en entier, revalidées côté serveur). Question, mode et contexte viennent du plan persisté. Réponse identique à POST /courses/generate. Codes: 200 ok, 404 plan inconnu, 410 plan expiré, 422 plan invalide (1 à 80 sections, au moins une 'development', title non vide, order ≥ 1), 429 quota Gemini, 502 tous les lots en échec, 503 Gemini indisponible."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /courses/history",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/history?page=1&limit=20",
